# local scratch, not the repo docs
CLAUDE.md

# Scratch screenshots dropped at the repo root. Real art lives in
# assets/ and client/assets/, so anything loose up here is throwaway and
# tends to carry whatever else was on screen when it was taken.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg

